{"data":[{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-02-01T17:45:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1885746198105260048"],"id":"1885746198105260048","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":82228,"like_count":60,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"嗯，这家店蛮有意思的😌 https://t.co/KufWuvRUHO","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1885746198105260048"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-02-01T01:55:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1885507270613885243"],"id":"1885507270613885243","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":30,"impression_count":151730,"like_count":280,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":29,"retweet_count":6},"text":"吉原有一家泡泡浴店，明确说明了就不接待外国人，\n之前跟他老板聊天时候，当我面说中国人脏，最讨厌中国人…\n然后就总有国人去这个店，最主要的是还冒充台湾人，结果被店里直接轰出来了，还来了句台湾人不也是中国人吗？\n妈的，人挺恶心，政治觉悟倒挺高…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1885507270613885243"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-01-31T14:27:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1885334175823417559"],"id":"1885334175823417559","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":26,"impression_count":92878,"like_count":66,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"开始在风俗百科里更新我最新写的书了，我写一点会发一点，只不过会删减一部分敏感的描写和所有的图片。但应该不会对了解男性按摩内容本身产生偏差。真正做出来的实体书则是带图片的完整版。\n登录用的用户名和密码是会员圈子里的用户名密码。 https://t.co/aHrDTUwTta","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1885334175823417559"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-01-31T08:01:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1885236885976735759"],"id":"1885236885976735759","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":37,"impression_count":129247,"like_count":147,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":6},"text":"一个日本妹子，找我帮她做fantia，\n我也没想太多就说想做就做呗，\n需要多少钱我给你拿，\n需要技术我帮你搞，\n你去找身边的妹子拍就行。\n\n研究半天发现，\n最难的原来不是资金问题，\n而是男优找不到…\n我一直以为这玩意就是随便拍拍得了，\n原来他们日本人拍个打炮也会拍的这么专业，","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1885236885976735759"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-01-28T15:27:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1884262023137222673"],"id":"1884262023137222673","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":71481,"like_count":76,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"text":"大家过年好，给大家拜年了","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1884262023137222673"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-01-26T11:41:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1883480466508153182"],"id":"1883480466508153182","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":16,"impression_count":78976,"like_count":91,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":3},"text":"开始写下一本书了，会详细的给你们讲一下日本的メンエス世界。全部写完之后会找个女优帮我拍一下插图。\n到时候圈子里会发一份无图的电子版，圈子会员可以免费看。 https://t.co/mbZ4BPIUIr","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1883480466508153182"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-01-24T05:59:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1882669417248735648"],"id":"1882669417248735648","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":101,"impression_count":135192,"like_count":215,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":4},"text":"现在メンエス服务真的越来越爽了，\n那服务意识和密着度简直满点！！！\n价格又便宜，女孩质量超级高，又能大活小活做到最后。\n如此一比较，泡泡浴完全没有优势了啊…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1882669417248735648"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-01-23T02:55:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1882260871034146829"],"id":"1882260871034146829","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":22,"impression_count":121495,"like_count":96,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":0},"text":"卧槽最近怎么出的AV女优的新人这么多？？？\n而且开盘价为啥都上去了…🧐🧐 https://t.co/jpqfSNgMip","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1882260871034146829"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-01-22T10:11:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1882008295025844457"],"id":"1882008295025844457","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":74689,"like_count":61,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":1},"text":"认识@pigu_majosama 这么多年，她居然不老…🧐🧐🧐 https://t.co/uKAf7DVj5v","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1882008295025844457"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-01-22T04:42:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1881925441084440969"],"id":"1881925441084440969","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":526,"impression_count":163319,"like_count":910,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":77},"text":"日本不同的风俗种类，想了解详细的在圈子和风俗百科里有写。 https://t.co/zKWD8Rb9eT","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1881925441084440969"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-01-21T12:37:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1881682478748119124"],"id":"1881682478748119124","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":45,"impression_count":111560,"like_count":281,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":8},"text":"姿势都准备好了，准备开始干活了 https://t.co/MczQSznFMj","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1881682478748119124"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-01-21T11:38:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1881667786390560968"],"id":"1881667786390560968","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":51602,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"开个直播试着聊一下？\n\nhttps://t.co/GLw4xteU40","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1881667786390560968"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-01-21T10:34:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1881651459911307544"],"id":"1881651459911307544","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":70016,"like_count":58,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"去过池袋的好多中华料理店，\n你吃着吃着饭老板就会凑过来问你菜怎么样。\n你说正常问问也就罢了，\n他非要那种洗脑式问法，\n问你这菜是不是不错？是不是挺好吃？\n你说你也不能说不好吃，\n只是感觉这种问法有些多此一举…\n最主要的是后厨大师傅还握着菜刀盯着你呢… https://t.co/cSJnkxLv5c","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1881651459911307544"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-01-20T06:30:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1881227839221227932"],"id":"1881227839221227932","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":75560,"like_count":40,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"在东京的中国银行办事效率真的是…\n工作时间的时候一个小时才办理两三个人，\n到了下班的时间，\n从后面出来一个人，\n五分钟时间办了在排队等候的所有人的业务，\n你早有这么快效率，\n你为啥不在上班时候来用？ https://t.co/B0dZrgqMNH","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1881227839221227932"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-01-16T09:37:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1879825389624946875"],"id":"1879825389624946875","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":51,"impression_count":88919,"like_count":222,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":7},"text":"我再在外面滑雪不回东京上班的话，大哥们该急眼了😂😂😂 https://t.co/eamwqZzeMo","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1879825389624946875"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-01-13T02:18:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1878627557991694629"],"id":"1878627557991694629","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":89669,"like_count":67,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我发现我真的是个很好的猎头…\n我给身边老板招的女司机，就没有老板不满意的…😂","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1878627557991694629"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-01-13T00:14:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1878596549514817602"],"id":"1878596549514817602","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":23,"impression_count":87147,"like_count":82,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":4},"text":"在二世谷一个开吃熊掌餐厅的哥们说，现在只要能在二世谷拿一个店铺，就算再怎么偏再怎么小，一个月上亿的营业额都是轻轻松松。\n一个是因为物价高，再一个是去那里的人是真不拿钱当钱啊…\n不光是中国人。泰国缅甸那些东南亚的土豪占了他们店消费群体的绝大多数。 https://t.co/beH3IoDIgQ","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1878596549514817602"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-01-11T01:29:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1877890485840392424"],"id":"1877890485840392424","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":67847,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"这几天在二世谷陪客人，天天的啥活也干不了🙂","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1877890485840392424"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-01-06T00:25:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1876062495452053849"],"id":"1876062495452053849","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":65149,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":1},"text":"过完年了，开始上班了😊\n可以找时间测试一下直播系统了","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1876062495452053849"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-01-02T10:12:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1874760417589